                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.3.1 (2026-02-28)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removed &lt;code&gt;mgmt-debug&lt;/code&gt; flag that was accidentally left in the released library, which added unnecessary &lt;code&gt;Serialized Name:&lt;/code&gt; comments to XML doc comments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.KeyVault_1.2.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.KeyVault_1.2.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.2.0-beta.1 (2026-02-28)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regenerated from the latest &lt;code&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.KeyVault&lt;/code&gt; package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for API version &lt;code&gt;2025-05-01&lt;/code&gt; across all KeyVault and ManagedHsm resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added &lt;code&gt;ManagedHsmServiceTagRule&lt;/code&gt; model and &lt;code&gt;ServiceTags&lt;/code&gt; property on &lt;code&gt;ManagedHsmNetworkRuleSet&lt;/code&gt; for service tag-based network rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
